MODULE: ExclusiveWorkResizeUnannounced
TARGET: ExclusiveWork
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: resize skips publishing intent and probing the migration record
PERTURBS: ResizeAnnounce

--- FIND
    /\ resize' = "announced" /\ resizeUsed' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
    /\ resize' = "active" /\ resizeUsed' = TRUE
--- END
